ps2_call_list.h is a byte-for-byte copy of ps2xRuntime/include/ps2_call_list.h from the pinned PS2Recomp
submodule (third_party/PS2Recomp), so it carries no header of its own. The CTest abi.call_list_parity fails when
the two differ; copy the file again whenever the submodule moves.
